packet mean `\bar k_*(\epsilon)`, not the carrier of an un-smeared plane
wave, and

\[
 c_1\epsilon\le |\bar k_*(\epsilon)|\le c_2\epsilon          \tag{SPEC.1}
\]

with the sign fixed by the chosen one-sided profile.

